@startuml
' ==============================================================================
' Tên sơ đồ: Sequence Diagram - Lập bảng (US-PAY-01), Trình duyệt (US-PAY-02),
'           Duyệt/Từ chối/Chỉnh sửa lại (US-PAY-03) & Điều chỉnh (US-PAY-04)
' Mục đích: Mô tả trình tự tương tác nhất quán với API Contract, Class Design
'           và 8 quyết định đã xác nhận của nhóm (ISS-01..ISS-08).
' Chuẩn tham chiếu: OMG UML 2.5.1
' Trạng thái kết xuất: Đã kiểm tra kết xuất thành công (PlantUML 1.2021.00)
' Liên kết yêu cầu: US-PAY-01..05, PAY-01..08, NFR-01..02, ISS-01..08
' ==============================================================================

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "NVKD" as NVKD
actor "KTT / GĐKD" as Approver
participant ":PaymentStatementsController" as Ctrl
participant ":PaymentStatementAppService" as AppSvc
participant ":IContractReadService" as ContractPort
participant ":IVolumeReadService" as VolumePort
participant ":IPriceListReadService" as PricePort
participant "statement:PaymentStatement" as Domain
participant ":IPaymentStatementRepository" as StatementRepo
participant ":IPaymentAuditLogRepository" as AuditRepo
participant ":INotificationService" as NotifSvc

== 1. US-PAY-01: Lập bảng thanh toán (Phản hồi < 3s với < 200 dòng - NFR-02, ISS-04, ISS-05) ==

NVKD -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/payment-statements (contractId, periodCode, note)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> AppSvc : CreateStatementAsync(req, actorId, ct)
activate AppSvc

AppSvc -> StatementRepo : ExistsNonCancelledForPeriodAsync(contractId, periodCode, ct)
activate StatementRepo
StatementRepo --> AppSvc : exists : bool
deactivate StatementRepo

alt Đã tồn tại bảng thanh toán chưa bị hủy (Status != Cancelled) trong cùng kỳ (PAY-01, ISS-04, ISS-05)
    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 409 Conflict (PAY_01_DUPLICATE_ACTIVE_PERIOD_STATEMENT)
    Ctrl --> NVKD : 409 Conflict
else Chưa tồn tại bảng active trong kỳ
    AppSvc -> ContractPort : GetContractSummaryAsync(contractId, ct)
    activate ContractPort
    ContractPort --> AppSvc : contractDto (Status, BillingCycleType, MandatoryServiceIds)
    deactivate ContractPort

    alt Hợp đồng không Active hoặc kỳ không khớp cấu hình Tháng/Quý (PAY-01, ISS-04)
        AppSvc --> Ctrl : 422 Unprocessable Entity
        Ctrl --> NVKD : 422 Unprocessable Entity
    else Hợp đồng Active & đúng cấu hình kỳ
        AppSvc -> VolumePort : GetPeriodVolumeAsync(contractId, period, ct)
        activate VolumePort
        VolumePort --> AppSvc : volumeDto (IsReconciled, Items)
        deactivate VolumePort

        alt Sản lượng kỳ chưa ở trạng thái "Đã đối soát" (PAY-02)
            AppSvc --> Ctrl : 422 Unprocessable Entity (PAY_02_VOLUME_NOT_RECONCILED)
            Ctrl --> NVKD : 422 Unprocessable Entity
        else Sản lượng đã đối soát
            AppSvc -> PricePort : GetApplicablePriceListAsync(contractId, period, ct)
            activate PricePort
            PricePort --> AppSvc : priceListDto
            deactivate PricePort

            alt Không có bảng giá phù hợp (PAY-01)
                AppSvc --> Ctrl : 422 Unprocessable Entity (PAY_01_PRICE_LIST_NOT_FOUND)
                Ctrl --> NVKD : 422 Unprocessable Entity
            else Có bảng giá phù hợp
                AppSvc -> Domain : CreateDraft(contractId, period, lineInputs, actorId, note)
                activate Domain
                Domain --> AppSvc : statement (Status = Draft, LineAmount = Quantity * UnitPrice)
                deactivate Domain

                AppSvc -> StatementRepo : AddAsync(statement, ct)
                activate StatementRepo
                StatementRepo --> AppSvc : ok
                deactivate StatementRepo

                AppSvc -> AuditRepo : AddAsync(auditLog("Created", null, "Draft"), ct)
                activate AuditRepo
                AuditRepo --> AppSvc : ok
                deactivate AuditRepo

                AppSvc --> Ctrl : 201 Created (PaymentStatementDto)
                Ctrl --> NVKD : 201 Created
            end
        end
    end
end
deactivate AppSvc
deactivate Ctrl

== 2. US-PAY-02: Trình duyệt bảng thanh toán (PAY-04, ISS-02, ISS-07, ISS-08) ==

NVKD -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/payment-statements/{id}/submit (Idempotency-Key, rowVersion)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> AppSvc : SubmitStatementAsync(id, idempotencyKey, rowVersion, actorId, ct)
activate AppSvc

AppSvc -> StatementRepo : GetByIdAsync(id, ct)
activate StatementRepo
StatementRepo --> AppSvc : statement
deactivate StatementRepo

AppSvc -> ContractPort : GetContractSummaryAsync(statement.ContractId, ct)
activate ContractPort
ContractPort --> AppSvc : contractDto (MandatoryServiceIds)
deactivate ContractPort

AppSvc -> Domain : Submit(actorId, contractDto.MandatoryServiceIds)
activate Domain

alt Tổng tiền <= 0 hoặc thiếu dịch vụ trong MandatoryServiceIds (PAY-04, ISS-07)
    Domain --> AppSvc : throw DomainValidationException
    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 422 Unprocessable Entity
    Ctrl --> NVKD : 422 Unprocessable Entity
else Hợp lệ (TotalAmount > 0 & đủ MandatoryServiceIds)
    Domain --> AppSvc : Status = PendingApproval, requiredRole = (>= 500tr ? GDKD : KTT)
    deactivate Domain

    AppSvc -> StatementRepo : UpdateAsync(statement, ct)
    activate StatementRepo
    StatementRepo --> AppSvc : ok
    deactivate StatementRepo

    AppSvc -> AuditRepo : AddAsync(auditLog("Submitted", "Draft", "PendingApproval"), ct)
    activate AuditRepo
    AuditRepo --> AppSvc : ok
    deactivate AuditRepo

    AppSvc -> NotifSvc : NotifyApproverAsync(id, requiredRole, statement.CreatedBy, statement.TotalAmount, ct)
    activate NotifSvc
    note right of NotifSvc
      ISS-02: >= 500 triệu gửi GĐKD; < 500 triệu gửi KTT.
      ISS-08: Loại trừ CreatedBy (nếu người lập cũng là KTT thì gửi KTT khác).
    end note
    NotifSvc --> AppSvc : ok
    deactivate NotifSvc

    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 200 OK (Status = PendingApproval)
    Ctrl --> NVKD : 200 OK
end
deactivate AppSvc
deactivate Ctrl

== 3. US-PAY-03: Duyệt hoặc Từ chối & Chỉnh sửa lại (PAY-06..08, ISS-01, ISS-02, ISS-08) ==

alt Người duyệt chọn Duyệt (Approve)
    Approver -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/payment-statements/{id}/approve (rowVersion)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl -> AppSvc : ApproveStatementAsync(id, rowVersion, approverId, role, ct)
    activate AppSvc
    AppSvc -> Domain : Approve(approverId, role)
    activate Domain
    note right of Domain
      Kiểm tra ApproverId != CreatedBy (PAY-07, ISS-08)
      và Role khớp ngưỡng >= 500.000.000 (ISS-02)
    end note
    Domain --> AppSvc : Status = Approved
    deactivate Domain
    AppSvc -> StatementRepo : UpdateAsync(statement, ct)
    AppSvc -> AuditRepo : AddAsync(auditLog("Approved", "PendingApproval", "Approved"), ct)
    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 200 OK (Status = Approved)
    Ctrl --> Approver : 200 OK
    deactivate AppSvc
    deactivate Ctrl
else Người duyệt chọn Từ chối (Reject) -> Chuyển sang Rejected -> NVKD chuyển về Draft (ISS-01)
    Approver -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/payment-statements/{id}/reject (reason, rowVersion)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl -> AppSvc : RejectStatementAsync(id, reason, rowVersion, approverId, role, ct)
    activate AppSvc
    AppSvc -> Domain : Reject(approverId, role, reason)
    activate Domain
    Domain --> AppSvc : Status = Rejected (lưu reason - PAY-08, ISS-01)
    deactivate Domain
    AppSvc -> StatementRepo : UpdateAsync(statement, ct)
    AppSvc -> AuditRepo : AddAsync(auditLog("Rejected", "PendingApproval", "Rejected"), ct)
    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 200 OK (Status = Rejected)
    Ctrl --> Approver : 200 OK
    deactivate AppSvc
    deactivate Ctrl

    NVKD -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/payment-statements/{id}/revise (rowVersion)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl -> AppSvc : ReviseRejectedToDraftAsync(id, rowVersion, nvkdId, ct)
    activate AppSvc
    AppSvc -> Domain : ReviseToDraft(nvkdId)
    activate Domain
    Domain --> AppSvc : Status = Draft (ISS-01)
    deactivate Domain
    AppSvc -> StatementRepo : UpdateAsync(statement, ct)
    AppSvc -> AuditRepo : AddAsync(auditLog("RevisedToDraft", "Rejected", "Draft"), ct)
    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 200 OK (Status = Draft)
    Ctrl --> NVKD : 200 OK
    deactivate AppSvc
    deactivate Ctrl
end

== 4. US-PAY-04: KTT tạo bản ghi điều chỉnh riêng cho bảng đã Approved (PAY-05, ISS-03) ==

Approver -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/payment-statements/{id}/adjustments\n(confirmationDocUrl, reason, resyncFromUpdatedSource)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> AppSvc : CreateAdjustmentAsync(id, req, kttId, ct)
activate AppSvc
AppSvc -> Domain : CreateAdjustment(kttId, confirmationDocUrl, reason, updatedLines)
activate Domain
note right of Domain
  ISS-03: Bảng gốc Approved giữ nguyên bất biến (PAY-05).
  Tạo bản ghi PaymentAdjustment riêng:
  - Nếu AdjustedTotalAmount >= 500tr -> PendingGdkdApproval
  - Nếu AdjustedTotalAmount < 500tr -> Approved
end note
Domain --> AppSvc : adjustment
deactivate Domain
AppSvc -> StatementRepo : UpdateAsync(statement, ct)
AppSvc -> AuditRepo : AddAsync(auditLog("AdjustmentCreated", "Approved", adjustment.Status), ct)
AppSvc --> Ctrl : 201 Created (PaymentAdjustmentDto)
Ctrl --> Approver : 201 Created
deactivate AppSvc
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml